 "name": "Loop stability",
 "created": "2026-10-22T17:00:00.000Z",
 "modified": "2026-10-22T17:00:00.000Z",
 "files": [
  {
   "name": "ProbeCircuit.asc",
   "kind": "schematic",
   "text": "Version 4\r\nSHEET 1 800 400\r\nWIRE 0 0 80 0\r\nWIRE 160 0 208 0\r\nWIRE 208 0 240 0\r\nWIRE 320 0 400 0\r\nWIRE 208 0 208 64\r\nFLAG 0 0 p1\r\nIOPIN 0 0 BiDir\r\nFLAG 400 0 p2\r\nIOPIN 400 0 BiDir\r\nFLAG 208 0 x\r\nFLAG 208 144 0\r\nTEXT -32 -112 Left 2 ;Inside the LoopProbe: the loop signal goes in at p1 and out at p2 (left to right). Outside .stb all three sources are 0: a wire.\r\nTEXT -32 -80 Left 2 ;Vprb (0 V) is the ammeter: Iy = I(Vprb). Vinj is the series voltage injection, Iinj the shunt current injection into x. Vy = -V(x).\r\nTEXT -32 208 Left 2 ;.stb run 1: Vinj = 1 (AC). Run 3: Iinj = 1. Then D = Vy1·Iy3 - Vy3·Iy1, T(Tian) = 1/(Vy1 + Iy3 - 2·D) - 1, T(GFT) = 1/(1/D - 1).\r\nSYMBOL voltage 176 0 R90\r\nWINDOW 0 -32 56 VBottom 2\r\nWINDOW 3 32 56 VTop 2\r\nSYMATTR InstName Vprb\r\nSYMATTR Value 0\r\nSYMBOL voltage 336 0 R90\r\nWINDOW 0 -32 56 VBottom 2\r\nWINDOW 3 32 56 VTop 2\r\nSYMATTR InstName Vinj\r\nSYMATTR Value 0 AC 0\r\nSYMBOL current 208 144 R180\r\nWINDOW 0 -32 56 Right 2\r\nWINDOW 3 -32 24 Right 2\r\nSYMATTR InstName Iinj\r\nSYMATTR Value 0 AC 0\r\n"
  },
  {
   "name": "ProbeCircuit.asy",
   "kind": "symbol",
   "text": "Version 4\r\nSymbolType BLOCK\r\nRECTANGLE Normal -32 -12 32 12\r\nLINE Normal -48 0 -32 0\r\nLINE Normal 32 0 48 0\r\nLINE Normal -20 0 18 0\r\nLINE Normal 10 -5 18 0\r\nLINE Normal 10 5 18 0\r\nTEXT 0 -20 Center 0 T\r\nWINDOW 0 0 -32 Center 2\r\nSYMATTR Prefix X\r\nSYMATTR InstName LP1\r\nSYMATTR Description The LoopProbe drawn as a subcircuit of the project: double-click it to see Vprb, Vinj and Iinj.\r\nPIN -48 0 NONE 0\r\nPINATTR PinName p1\r\nPINATTR SpiceOrder 1\r\nPIN 48 0 NONE 0\r\nPINATTR PinName p2\r\nPINATTR SpiceOrder 2\r\n"
  },
  {
   "name": "BalunCircuit.asc",
   "kind": "schematic",
   "text": "Version 4\r\nSHEET 1 1000 600\r\nWIRE 64 64 192 64\r\nWIRE 192 144 192 192\r\nWIRE 192 272 192 320\r\nWIRE 320 64 448 64\r\nWIRE 448 144 448 192\r\nWIRE 448 272 448 320\r\nWIRE 640 64 768 64\r\nWIRE 768 64 864 64\r\nWIRE 640 320 768 320\r\nWIRE 768 320 864 320\r\nFLAG 64 64 p\r\nIOPIN 64 64 BiDir\r\nFLAG 320 64 n\r\nIOPIN 320 64 BiDir\r\nFLAG 864 64 d\r\nIOPIN 864 64 BiDir\r\nFLAG 864 320 c\r\nIOPIN 864 320 BiDir\r\nFLAG 144 208 d\r\nFLAG 144 256 0\r\nFLAG 144 336 c\r\nFLAG 144 384 0\r\nFLAG 192 400 0\r\nFLAG 400 208 d\r\nFLAG 400 256 0\r\nFLAG 400 336 c\r\nFLAG 400 384 0\r\nFLAG 448 400 0\r\nFLAG 640 144 0\r\nFLAG 768 144 0\r\nFLAG 640 400 0\r\nFLAG 768 400 0\r\nTEXT 32 -64 Left 2 ;Terminal side: V(p) = V(c) + V(d)/2 and V(n) = V(c) - V(d)/2 (E sources); Vsp and Vsn (0 V) measure I(p) and I(n).\r\nTEXT 32 -32 Left 2 ;Mode side: the F sources put the currents back as I(d) = (I(p) - I(n))/2 and I(c) = I(p) + I(n). Power is conserved.\r\nSYMBOL voltage 192 48 R0\r\nWINDOW 0 24 32 Left 2\r\nWINDOW 3 24 64 Left 2\r\nSYMATTR InstName Vsp\r\nSYMATTR Value 0\r\nSYMBOL e 192 176 R0\r\nSYMATTR InstName Ep\r\nSYMATTR Value 0.5\r\nSYMBOL e 192 304 R0\r\nSYMATTR InstName Ec\r\nSYMATTR Value 1\r\nSYMBOL voltage 448 48 R0\r\nWINDOW 0 24 32 Left 2\r\nWINDOW 3 24 64 Left 2\r\nSYMATTR InstName Vsn\r\nSYMATTR Value 0\r\nSYMBOL e 448 176 R0\r\nSYMATTR InstName En\r\nSYMATTR Value -0.5\r\nSYMBOL e 448 304 R0\r\nSYMATTR InstName Ec2\r\nSYMATTR Value 1\r\nSYMBOL f 640 144 R180\r\nWINDOW 0 -32 56 Right 2\r\nWINDOW 3 -32 24 Right 2\r\nSYMATTR InstName Fd\r\nSYMATTR Value Vsp 0.5\r\nSYMBOL f 768 144 R180\r\nWINDOW 0 -32 56 Right 2\r\nWINDOW 3 -32 24 Right 2\r\nSYMATTR InstName Fd2\r\nSYMATTR Value Vsn -0.5\r\nSYMBOL f 640 400 R180\r\nWINDOW 0 -32 56 Right 2\r\nWINDOW 3 -32 24 Right 2\r\nSYMATTR InstName Fc\r\nSYMATTR Value Vsp 1\r\nSYMBOL f 768 400 R180\r\nWINDOW 0 -32 56 Right 2\r\nWINDOW 3 -32 24 Right 2\r\nSYMATTR InstName Fc2\r\nSYMATTR Value Vsn 1\r\n"
  },
  {
   "name": "BalunCircuit.asy",
   "kind": "symbol",
   "text": "Version 4\r\nSymbolType BLOCK\r\nRECTANGLE Normal -32 -48 32 48\r\nLINE Normal -48 -32 -32 -32\r\nLINE Normal -48 32 -32 32\r\nLINE Normal 32 -32 48 -32\r\nLINE Normal 32 32 48 32\r\nARC Normal -14 -24 -2 -12 -8 -12 -8 -24\r\nARC Normal -14 -12 -2 0 -8 0 -8 -12\r\nARC Normal -14 0 -2 12 -8 12 -8 0\r\nARC Normal -14 12 -2 24 -8 24 -8 12\r\nARC Normal 2 -24 14 -12 8 -24 8 -12\r\nARC Normal 2 -12 14 0 8 -12 8 0\r\nARC Normal 2 0 14 12 8 0 8 12\r\nARC Normal 2 12 14 24 8 12 8 24\r\nTEXT -28 -36 Left 0 p\r\nTEXT -28 36 Left 0 n\r\nTEXT 28 -36 Right 0 d\r\nTEXT 28 36 Right 0 c\r\nWINDOW 0 0 -60 Center 2\r\nSYMATTR Prefix X\r\nSYMATTR InstName B1\r\nSYMATTR Description The Balun drawn as a subcircuit of the project: double-click it to see its E and F sources.\r\nPIN -48 -32 NONE 0\r\nPINATTR PinName p\r\nPINATTR SpiceOrder 1\r\nPIN -48 32 NONE 0\r\nPINATTR PinName n\r\nPINATTR SpiceOrder 2\r\nPIN 48 -32 NONE 0\r\nPINATTR PinName d\r\nPINATTR SpiceOrder 3\r\nPIN 48 32 NONE 0\r\nPINATTR PinName c\r\nPINATTR SpiceOrder 4\r\n"
  }
 ],
